## 4) `vercel.json` (optional, helpful)
Create `vercel.json` to ensure static behaviour and set a nice `cleanUrls` option:

```json
{
  "version": 2,
  "builds": [
    { "src": "index.html", "use": "@vercel/static" }
  ],
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "routes": [
    { "src": "/", "dest": "/index.html" }
  ]
}
